 .\nAlbums\, clothing\, jeweled prism chandelier\, crates\, purses\, MCM c
 rystal waterfall lamps\, boots\, furniture\, lamps and lighting\, origina
 l artwork\, vintage posters\, outdoor furniture\, live plants\, vintage W
 ashington Redskins memorabilia\, outdoor concrete decor and planters.\nSt
 ar Wars\, bronze\, art deco spice jars\, apothecary bottles\, Folk art do
 lls including African American and Mexican\, Loredano Rosin Murano sculpt
 ures\, vintage signs\, linens\, Steiff bears\, Hollywood Regency vanity\,
  MCM furniture\, Fiestaware\, holiday\, garage items including ladders\, 
 tools\, hand trucks and more.\nSunday is bundle day!\nFor planning purpos
 es\, this home is close to Inman Park in Somerset\, NJ
